WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.000
Follow military orders

00:15.240 --> 00:16.640
Fire arrows

00:21.400 --> 00:22.800
Fire arrows

00:27.240 --> 00:28.640
No

00:34.440 --> 00:34.960
Hurry

00:35.040 --> 00:36.440
Move forward

00:37.080 --> 00:39.360
Hurry, no retreat, retreat and die

00:43.480 --> 00:45.080
Archers ready

00:51.960 --> 00:54.640
The northern expedition may one day succeed

00:54.960 --> 00:57.480
But they will never see it

00:58.040 --> 00:59.800
Blood fills the air below the walls

00:59.880 --> 01:01.400
Your throat tightens

01:01.560 --> 01:02.760
Your stomach churns

01:02.840 --> 01:05.173
But you remain on the city walls

01:05.520 --> 01:06.480
You know

01:06.560 --> 01:07.680
For the rest of your life

01:07.760 --> 01:09.680
You will never forget today's scene

01:10.440 --> 01:12.520
When the time comes to drive out the Wuzhao

01:12.600 --> 01:14.560
You will repay them a hundredfold

01:15.920 --> 01:17.320
Fire arrows

01:51.640 --> 01:53.360
Fire arrows

